  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000rehl](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000rehl) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 148.223 depth occurred on Nov 28 2025 55km NE of Tapachula. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 15.3705 longitude -92.0886. It impacted 983660 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
